{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國演藝圈情侶李光洙與李先彬，自2018年被爆出戀情後，雙方隨即大方認愛，並坦承已交往五個月。其實早在兩位正式交往之前，李先彬就曾公開透露李光洙是她的理想型。後來兩人透過《Running Man》認識發展出戀情。</p><p>近日，兩人在韓國多處被網友目擊手牽手逛街，特別是193cm的李光洙與166cm的李先彬之間27cm的身高差，再次成為社群的熱門話題。根據韓媒11月11日報導，這對情侶在購物中心及街頭低調約會，親密互動吸引網友熱議。</p><figure><img alt=\"李光洙與李先彬在韓國多處被網友目擊手牽手逛街。（Instagram@issue_orbit）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197543939511422976452910.jpeg/mpp3yn7I7mkeOhWuBrMpfA7MhQ_XYU-CAbFNUAGxTVA\"/><figcaption>李光洙與李先彬在韓國多處被網友目擊手牽手逛街。（Instagram@issue_orbit）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"特別是193cm的李光洙與166cm的李先彬之間27公分的身高差，再次成為社群的熱門話題。（Instagram@issue_orbit）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197543941931667456764503.jpeg/UZuxCuq4gynjp20GPKnjT1vdRtz_XJOTrar6Eq2q-hI\"/><figcaption>特別是193cm的李光洙與166cm的李先彬之間27公分的身高差，再次成為社群的熱門話題。（Instagram@issue_orbit）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李光洙與李先彬近日在購物中心及商店多處被拍到一同出現。兩人穿著休閒，帽子與口罩等配件低調打扮，展現多年來的自在與默契，並肩行走時手自然牽在一起，互動親密。（Instagram@issue_orbit）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197543943869566976652430.jpeg/5RcccHVZflHvX8xFKJqIfo04Gm5gqe0ZtvdO0rb3TtI\"/><figcaption>李光洙與李先彬近日在購物中心及商店多處被拍到一同出現。兩人穿著休閒，帽子與口罩等配件低調打扮，展現多年來的自在與默契，並肩行走時手自然牽在一起，互動親密。（Instagram@issue_orbit）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李光洙官方身高193cm，李先彬則為166cm，相差27cm的「身高差」讓網友直呼「這個身高差真的讓人心動」、「簡直像浪漫韓劇的一幕」。（Instagram@issue_orbit）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197543946180759552892674.jpeg/lJfxYJI69avgipMmyPBZXSGgy0ry9nA9EJZe4RCWXuE\"/><figcaption>李光洙官方身高193cm，李先彬則為166cm，相差27cm的「身高差」讓網友直呼「這個身高差真的讓人心動」、「簡直像浪漫韓劇的一幕」。（Instagram@issue_orbit）</figcaption></figure><p>公開約會畫面瘋傳　網友大讚像韓劇情節</p><p>根據韓國媒體報導，李光洙與李先彬近日在購物中心及商店多處被拍到一同出現。兩人穿著休閒，帽子與口罩等配件低調打扮，展現多年來的自在與默契，並肩行走時手自然牽在一起，互動親密。</p><p>有網友表示，今年3月，他們也曾在首爾漢江公園被目擊帶著愛犬散步，當時李光洙牽著狗狗，李先彬則坐在野餐墊上，兩人自然的相處模式受到民眾稱讚。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：李光洙李善彬愛情長跑9年　揭私下真實互動：更常聊無關緊要小事】李光洙與李善彬已經戀愛長跑9年。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268345/org/81ec93a42894df1b10ff5fd7a9b27560.JPG/_dmu0Xxx5O-ZlCxC29_MHdXCcmzB4kpBhJz72oSc-9o\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：李光洙李善彬愛情長跑9年　揭私下真實互動：更常聊無關緊要小事】李光洙與李善彬已經戀愛長跑9年。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268349/org/126915234e0b8257a48cce0d5a7f5e79.PNG/dTN8UwABEKYHQaENUrBTudnhdRzWW_oablt3kG5bd5A\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268350/org/a054d355f06cbd8bb07178302c5f438b.PNG/PNTAG-22QHxxAvc14jYO2QQ1waW5sOcCsylk6rMpZOo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268353/org/d421149ed874c46ab3f19ea9b790ba1b.PNG/bhfex6daivEHJinXP4JDquGYjbkrsu0DehpklHoaZJQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268358/org/23c32de9057b11a2872832bcdd1a0692.PNG/34oGKmNkj6AUL90wh9-Y0kmcvs2Wg8Cc-fxPFPn8TxQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268359/org/a9dd408a9619f118aee1290b8fc6b7aa.PNG/y0Xftol7JsXBkxn-frtFcZmRpoV8elczsu1bGbLtWxk\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268351/org/fc8bbc04c242ac6375c23562793e6851.PNG/30R2pV3HpZjAl3tmBQwstWhgBo7-0FyQzNZbbszWW24\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268352/org/f4a3788160e785190b9db46455d682fe.PNG/4FtQxizUQ793SjnseFbE_nJUrcTGaH1QnxDSJp8Q0iY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268354/org/892e80432bd93f8d0584a039828b44a9.PNG/eO_RbtYkLN776HapqmIbocNPT3aS850HRKjlL0So5S8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268360/org/b330357a72f5563dbf6d9a1e0ee3f365.PNG/ORnjf3gTqsyTzHxHuaA0TX9I63rDtfFMNzuhXjc7oV4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268355/org/028e5862e3b6b44873a1ea4c73ef0199.PNG/6Veay0cfoApa1iX9BC20eWPSEDj0XoT-OJElaTiRJWk\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268357/org/66227518d6582e280dd64764bbf7b41e.PNG/abAxEoBzXYU-4EtrfcVHTL-Lf84stWUQu3k9ELt5PRA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268356/org/78682852d6333957095bac709d8054c4.PNG/_JlImR5R1XS6rTYesMnxQ7zHTMW8TFbSH9DG-B_Qxvg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268366/org/592eeac0c005b8732fe0869f4a3c90b5.PNG/5XjXy2-Oe-nluX-u134sKW83H1KoU4klz2kEAM9pBAA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268367/org/9526e8f9ba7317b03a1db1d464671630.PNG/U5ld281NsnGUKqVUAsKSmUtFmp8vAC9RUVKm41FSpuM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268361/org/87e128d8727bd6aa6646c0513ae25ed0.PNG/LlUnjapKxCkj7RCaXdyJd9wIHn-geK0laNiCmGjYgpg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268362/org/b2994efd565cede2b92747e0df49be69.PNG/MRGNMFLW-T5dCxyxatM-bDprZxKqH7QZX6VCrV-lQq0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268365/org/eeaa40884819fc779ce07ebce040e272.PNG/2rjyzHNH889EHT8DHwf2ADx8jCfAtpP_IKzJBSCsyQU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268363/org/f48af0dc819cf188ab85b5c203d91f85.PNG/YXcG7zIohOaogekqUcFaTemZfXqNEaRC4TB9NuEwfTY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2268364/org/caf129e661ef6c44971fa1f2365adaf5.PNG/ba6FFVfx8W_GfZHOkfP0p9R6SxXlT2IyFYvIhhWLyIY\"/><p>除了約會之外，兩人明顯的身高差也成為焦點之一。李光洙官方身高193cm，李先彬則為166cm，相差27cm的「身高差」讓網友直呼：</p><p>「這個身高差真的讓人心動」</p><p>「簡直像浪漫韓劇的一幕」</p><p>兩人戀情始於2016年綜藝節目《Running Man》的相識，2018年12月正式公開交往，至今已近9年。李光洙於今年4月參加YouTube頻道《뜬뜬》（DdeunDdeun）時，劉在錫曾開玩笑問兩人在漢江約會是否為行銷，李光洙則當場反問「那為什麼會是行銷啊？」現場氣氛輕鬆愉快。兩人雖鮮少高調放閃，但偶爾曝光的約會畫面，總讓外界見證這對情侶的甜蜜互動。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：宋仲基一家四口出遊推BB車做廿四孝爸爸　3歲仔暴風抽高直逼腰部】日前有網民目擊宋仲基一家四口一起到漢江郊遊。（網絡圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194656192115249152598170.png/PZcSOzGaJkLzK976O1_2JdC7YDgP4AR9LcLIZy3CyGc\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：宋仲基一家四口出遊推BB車做廿四孝爸爸　3歲仔暴風抽高直逼腰部】日前有網民目擊宋仲基一家四口一起到漢江郊遊。（網絡圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527877980426240934560.jpeg/KLPLKV8EG5Q0Urkb4-HCLwOO5tusDU44Tj5Duk4-Q7o\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527876440985600058619.jpeg/zLuWEZQGPbCA2L5MMtbMAlc3N3NTT-n7_Dga5_w4Guc\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527875937669120059138.jpeg/6QNc6kJKL-hiNdc4VBsjrdMZt-LWW008Z2OcRGdjnEQ\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527878924144640762894.jpeg/FwFa-uOu0mNc1-pUBOrY28-7Ex5a1mLA6MBnOOjAZzg\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527877644881920940283.jpeg/Q2XFL16hTyOaZE5XrOnw_uF6S5l1ZhwkMoOJjDKDiYw\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527876071886848429751.jpeg/J_0JzlpMMML1qTfzuvFFYDyxPjlDaeuX0aBTQtGgU0I\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527872242225152940561.jpeg/TFdiifdQMAs25b3w3WV71FsiyP1SilEUryjJmK8oyZg\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527874175930368850473.jpeg/fCKRN-bK8LQIxdx2y7j2NZ0DGkBKqP0Dj8cE6I_HBOg\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527873982992384129036.jpeg/ZvD23Dp0w6QWN9IDvVWwBhmECRby1uHXs7zpDrO86Q4\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527872485625856764981.jpeg/bjyZuHRzTjUwx8QaRtr8bCH9dhxhNjwsv-3Qmr_t0Jo\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527874343702528042761.jpeg/U7V338MofVEJO5hpDVRx4NNyJxwslRiZRBJK0kQSStI\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527872208670720124379.jpeg/NLmJDKech2JfTY_ZdlscAqC5nsPxAZJPnTjWNZ041jU\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527872145756160064523.jpeg/ePCaJfkJbDoFMMN0Cm1TCMxtjHCdhAA0WGM-tVhjPrU\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527870459514880269058.jpeg/Yb6h8-53kkIAltananT7Tz5Ws0UCG4UtM6YH-DOmB_g\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527868756627456163429.jpeg/E2uJXM5N4fc6Qij55mHC3LAxcmxrLEHiqINcaqiDXGo\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527870702915584924387.jpeg/CN-OrGsJQFtGxx4cLIgtP7JC-TqORc1uM26foDNun6A\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250116/956527870115581952923861.jpeg/Swk8kxthrZT2xEH44DUPPWb1N_PRJbUtqhkaT6oZGk8\"/><figcaption>宋仲基（IG@hi_songjoongki）</figcaption></figure><p>被爆復合國手舊愛！王心恬首露面傻眼「太烏龍了」　親揭和姚元浩現在關係</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T11:23:57.090399+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1544,"images":42,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:00:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T11:43:30.284853+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:17:25.988118+00:00","content_hash":"7695ec003ffb5dd3d9731cd259da7732094d7b6067e985880ecdda2d5abd302c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"co